 italic;font-family:="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-style:'>t</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">＝</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>2</span><span 'times="" italic;font-family:="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-style:'>t</span><sub new="" roman\"="" word-font='\"Times'><span>0</span></sub><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">时刻，小车的速度大小为</span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"2\"' size='\"6\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　　　</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">。</span></p>",
