  }, {
    "html" : "<p style='\"\"'><span class='\"ques-no\"'>4. </span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">某同学将小车的干电池取出，用如图（</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>c</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">）所示的电路测量其电动势和内阻，图中电压传感器未画出，定值电阻</span><span 'times="" italic;font-family:="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-style:'>R</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">＝</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>5.0Ω</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">。连接电路，点击开始记录，得到图（</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>d</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">）中的数据点</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>①</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">；闭合开关</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>S</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，移动滑动变阻器的滑片依次得到数据点</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>②</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">、</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>③</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">、</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>④</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">、</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>⑤</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">。</span></p><p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><img height='\"166\"' src="https://resource.malongtech.cn/questions/img/3685468024963072/b5fa68ed-6e1a-42e9-a2e4-4d3365264235.png" width='\"446\"'/></p><p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">（</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>1</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">）根据实验数据，可知电压表接在</span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"3\"' size='\"6\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　　　</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">和</span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"4\"' size='\"6\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　　　</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">之间（用图</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>c</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">中字母表示）。</span></p><p left;\"="" style='\"text-align:'><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">（</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>2</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">）测得该电池的电动势为</span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"5\"' size='\"6\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　　　</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>V</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">，内阻为</span><span class='\"qml-bk\"' index='\"6\"' size='\"6\"' style='\"text-decoration:underline\"' type='\"underline\"'>　　　　　　</span><span 'times="" new="" roman';\"="" style='\"font-family:'>Ω</span><span style='\"font-family:' 宋体;\"="">。（结果均保留两位有效数字）</span></p>",
